00:12:47.602 --> 00:12:50.313
has hypnotic powers
that show us illusions.

00:12:50.522 --> 00:12:54.901
He's probably the key to this organization's
ability to brainwash people through fear.

00:12:55.110 --> 00:12:58.947
It's a good thing he took my brother,
who I can talk to telepathically.

00:12:59.155 --> 00:13:01.032
So he's alive...

00:13:01.241 --> 00:13:04.577
But that doesn't change the fact that
this is a dangerous organization.

00:13:04.786 --> 00:13:07.664
And that's exactly why
we can't stay here long.

00:13:07.872 --> 00:13:09.624
We'll strike tonight,

00:13:09.833 --> 00:13:13.420
while the trainers are
still underestimating us.

00:13:13.628 --> 00:13:17.507
H-Hey, those guys are
discussing something.

00:13:17.716 --> 00:13:19.634
Are they plotting to escape?

00:13:19.843 --> 00:13:23.179
Let them. It's no use anyway.

00:13:23.388 --> 00:13:25.140
I know it's a terrible time
to bring this up...

00:13:25.348 --> 00:13:30.312
--What's wrong?
--Before I tell you all my plan, what were your,

00:13:30.520 --> 00:13:32.188
um...

00:13:32.397 --> 00:13:34.816
...names again?

00:13:35.025 --> 00:13:39.487
S-Seriously?! You didn't even
remember our names?!

00:13:39.696 --> 00:13:44.826
You always were hard to read
with that gloomy face of yours...

00:13:45.035 --> 00:13:48.705
Now, now... I guess we'll just
have to introduce ourselves again.

00:13:48.913 --> 00:13:50.623
I'm Kurosaki Rei.

00:13:50.832 --> 00:13:52.417
My specialty is clairvoyance.

00:13:52.625 --> 00:13:55.128
--Pleasure to work with you, Kageyama-kun.
--Likewise.

00:13:55.337 --> 00:13:56.713
I'm Hoshino Takeshi.

00:13:56.921 --> 00:13:59.799
I have super strong telekinetic powers.

00:14:00.008 --> 00:14:01.217
I'm Asahi Go.

00:14:01.426 --> 00:14:04.679
I'm called the godsend who can
burn everything in his path.

00:14:04.888 --> 00:14:06.598
By whom, exactly?

00:14:06.806 --> 00:14:08.516
Pleasure to work with you both.

00:14:08.725 --> 00:14:10.560
I'm Shiratori Daichi.

00:14:10.769 --> 00:14:13.438
The guy who got taken away
is my little brother Kaito.

00:14:13.646 --> 00:14:17.150
Let's hurry up and rescue Kaito-kun
and get the heck out of here.

00:14:17.359 --> 00:14:19.152
But do you have a plan?

00:14:19.361 --> 00:14:23.198
Also, the trainers are right there.

00:14:23.406 --> 00:14:26.701
I think they already know
that we're trying to escape.

00:14:26.910 --> 00:14:29.871
I'm sure there were other kids
who tried to do the same thing.

00:14:30.080 --> 00:14:32.540
That would mean they're used
to dealing with escape attempts.

00:14:32.749 --> 00:14:34.918
There goes any chance we had.

00:14:35.126 --> 00:14:36.294
That's not entirely true.

00:14:36.503 --> 00:14:39.631
If they're underestimating our powers,
we'll be able to escape.

00:14:39.839 --> 00:14:41.424
How?

00:14:41.633 --> 00:14:44.386
They probably let their guard down
because we're kids.

00:14:44.594 --> 00:14:46.554
They didn't check our belongings.

00:14:46.763 --> 00:14:50.100
Do you really carry that around everywhere?

00:14:51.601 --> 00:14:54.312
Ignite!

00:14:56.523 --> 00:15:00.151
--Now, Hoshino!
--All right! There!

00:15:06.116 --> 00:15:07.742
Oh, it opened.

00:15:07.951 --> 00:15:10.078
I guess everything's worth a shot.

00:15:10.286 --> 00:15:13.123
Well done, brats. What now?

00:15:13.331 --> 00:15:15.291
What's your next move?

00:15:15.500 --> 00:15:17.669
Wh-What's our next move, Kageyama?

00:15:17.877 --> 00:15:20.171
Let me just warn you that
it's safer in that cell.

00:15:20.380 --> 00:15:24.092
If you step even one foot out of there,
we're going to have to discipline you.

00:15:24.300 --> 00:15:27.804
--Kageyama?
--Are you telling me you didn't plan this far ahead?

00:15:28.012 --> 00:15:30.640
Let's use Hoshino-kun's
super strong telekinesis

00:15:30.849 --> 00:15:33.852
and Asahi-kun's fire to get out of here.

00:15:35.937 --> 00:15:38.314
Well, isn't that adorable?

00:15:38.523 --> 00:15:39.732
Listen...

00:15:39.941 --> 00:15:43.903
...you can't move something as heavy
as a person with telekinesis.

00:15:44.112 --> 00:15:46.239
Even though I'm a pyrokinetic genius,

00:15:46.448 --> 00:15:49.951
I don't think I can set fire
to something that's moving.

00:15:50.160 --> 00:15:52.495
--I'll take care of it, then.
--Huh?

00:15:52.704 --> 00:15:56.040
Though I'm nowhere near
as good as you guys.

00:15:56.249 --> 00:15:59.169
Come on. Get out, everyone.

00:15:59.377 --> 00:16:01.296
You'll all be held responsible either way.

00:16:01.504 --> 00:16:04.924
Do you think we'd hold back
on you because you're kids?

00:16:05.133 --> 00:16:06.509
No.

00:16:06.718 --> 00:16:09.262
Why would I ever expect incompetent,
disposable lackeys like you

00:16:09.471 --> 00:16:12.265
to have that kind of common sense?

00:16:12.474 --> 00:16:14.809
Y-You're going to be killed, Kageyama.

00:16:15.018 --> 00:16:16.644
I see.

00:16:16.853 --> 00:16:20.190
Well, try protecting yourself with the
spoon-bending that you're so good at,

00:16:20.398 --> 00:16:22.734
Mr. Natural!

00:16:22.942 --> 00:16:24.986
Please, powers...

00:16:25.195 --> 00:16:27.447
...do as I say.

00:16:33.536 --> 00:16:35.038
Wh-Whoa...

00:16:35.246 --> 00:16:38.458
You probably didn't need us
to open the lock...

00:16:38.666 --> 00:16:43.379
No, we needed to show them
that we were powerless.

00:16:43.588 --> 00:16:46.633
This is a blind spot for
that security camera.

00:16:46.841 --> 00:16:48.927
Let's have them think we're
being disciplined for a while

00:16:49.135 --> 00:16:51.012
and quickly go rescue Kaito-kun.

00:16:51.221 --> 00:16:54.140
But I don't know where Kaito is.

00:16:54.349 --> 00:16:58.228
Kurosaki-san, now we're going to
have to rely on your clairvoyance.

00:16:58.436 --> 00:17:01.105
Huh? Me?

00:17:01.314 --> 00:17:03.775
Can we count on you?

00:17:03.983 --> 00:17:05.944
I-I'll try...

00:17:06.152 --> 00:17:09.614
Th-This is lame...

00:17:10.657 --> 00:17:13.284
There're some tough-looking guys
standing by the entrance.

00:17:13.493 --> 00:17:15.078
What do you wanna do?

00:17:15.286 --> 00:17:17.705
Shigeo, you need to think, too.

00:17:17.914 --> 00:17:19.415
Want to blow them away?

00:17:19.624 --> 00:17:21.751
Those strangers.

00:17:23.586 --> 00:17:26.256
L-Let's concentrate on rescuing Ritsu.

00:17:26.464 --> 00:17:29.342
--I knew it.
--Okay.

00:17:29.551 --> 00:17:34.264
--That technique...
--It's the Air Whips I just learned earlier.

00:17:41.437 --> 00:17:43.064
Sorry.

00:17:46.359 --> 00:17:50.405
It's easier to possess someone
when they're in shock.

00:17:50.613 --> 00:17:52.699
You seem used to this, Dimple-kun.

00:17:52.907 --> 00:17:54.742
Are you a pretty dangerous evil spirit?

00:17:54.951 --> 00:17:56.869
Of course not. Right, Shigeo?

00:17:57.078 --> 00:17:59.163
Dimple's dangerous.

00:17:59.372 --> 00:18:03.751
We might've been better off
if you'd possessed Terada.

00:18:03.960 --> 00:18:07.505
Espers all have mental protection on them,

00:18:07.714 --> 00:18:09.757
so they're hard for evil spirits to possess.

00:18:09.966 --> 00:18:12.010
That goes for you guys, too.

00:18:12.218 --> 00:18:15.972
Not to mention, I'm a lot weaker right now.

00:18:16.180 --> 00:18:19.392
Usually, I'd be able to
destroy people's minds.

00:18:19.601 --> 00:18:21.853
You weren't a big deal before, either.

00:18:22.061 --> 00:18:24.105
I was weakened then, too!

00:18:24.314 --> 00:18:25.481
Why are you weakened?

00:18:25.690 --> 00:18:28.234
Because you almost exorcised--

00:18:28.443 --> 00:18:30.111
Never mind.

00:18:30.320 --> 00:18:32.905
All right! Let's go!

00:18:35.700 --> 00:18:39.203
All right, we're good.
We're counting on you, Kurosaki-san.

00:18:39.412 --> 00:18:40.830
Okay.

00:18:44.167 --> 00:18:46.753
--This way next.
--Let's go.

00:18:48.755 --> 00:18:51.716
--All right, let's keep going.
--Okay.

00:18:55.720 --> 00:18:57.180
Who're you?

00:18:57.388 --> 00:18:59.057
Huh?

00:18:59.265 --> 00:19:01.142
Hey, are you trying to kill him?

00:19:01.351 --> 00:19:03.603
It's because we both hit him at once.

00:19:03.811 --> 00:19:05.480
Listen up, Kageyama-kun.

00:19:05.688 --> 00:19:07.857
Leave all the grunts to me.

00:19:08.066 --> 00:19:10.985
First, we need to find out where
they're holding your brother.

00:19:11.194 --> 00:19:13.905
Oh, right. Sorry...

00:19:14.113 --> 00:19:17.116
His casual attitude is throwing me off.
This is supposed to be a tense situation.

00:19:17.325 --> 00:19:19.118
Who are you?!

00:19:21.371 --> 00:19:23.414
You abducted some kids, didn't you?

00:19:23.623 --> 00:19:26.084
Tell us where they are.

00:19:26.876 --> 00:19:29.003
The children are in the basement...

00:19:29.212 --> 00:19:33.466
--He said the basement.
--Shigeo, apparently Ritsu's here.

00:19:33.675 --> 00:19:35.593
Thank goodness.

00:19:36.135 --> 00:19:39.472
You fools. We can hear you over the radio.

00:19:39.681 --> 00:19:41.474
We've got intruders. After them.

00:19:41.683 --> 00:19:44.227
Wait. Contact the Scars, too.

00:19:44.435 --> 00:19:46.979
They might be espers.

00:19:48.856 --> 00:19:50.775
An emergency, huh?

00:19:50.983 --> 00:19:52.527
It's gotta be him.

00:19:52.735 --> 00:19:55.279
That means Terada got his ass kicked.

00:19:55.488 --> 00:19:58.366
First Koyama, and now Terada...

00:19:58.574 --> 00:19:59.909
What's going on?

00:20:00.118 --> 00:20:02.912
Hey! I didn't lose!

00:20:03.121 --> 00:20:06.165
Terada just rushed into things!

00:20:06.374 --> 00:20:08.042
I'll take care of him.

00:20:08.251 --> 00:20:12.296
I'm delighted beyond words that
I get to see him again so soon.

00:20:12.505 --> 00:20:14.674
Are you saying we should
leave him to just you?

00:20:14.882 --> 00:20:17.510
Of course! Stay outta my way, you bastards!

00:20:17.719 --> 00:20:20.555
Don't rush into things.
There's more than one intruder.

00:20:20.763 --> 00:20:22.265
So what?

00:20:22.473 --> 00:20:23.808
You're going to lose again.

00:20:24.016 --> 00:20:26.936
Sakurai... You wanna die first?

00:20:27.145 --> 00:20:28.771
Stop it. You're both Scars.

00:20:28.980 --> 00:20:30.815
That's fine, Koyama-kun.

00:20:31.023 --> 00:20:32.358
Go ahead.

00:20:32.567 --> 00:20:36.654
But you won't get away with losing
to the same person twice.

00:20:36.863 --> 00:20:38.823
I know that.

00:20:39.532 --> 00:20:41.743
Now we're up against the clock.

00:20:41.951 --> 00:20:44.120
Let's split up and find your brother.

00:20:44.328 --> 00:20:46.038
I'll go right.

00:20:46.247 --> 00:20:48.583
Kageyama-kun, go down the middle.

00:20:50.334 --> 00:20:51.794
--Gah.
--Ah.

00:20:52.003 --> 00:20:55.214
Crap, the mini boss just appeared.

00:20:55.423 --> 00:20:58.009
I see...

00:20:58.217 --> 00:20:59.761
We meet again.

00:20:59.969 --> 00:21:02.847
I beat the crap outta you,
and you can already move?

00:21:03.055 --> 00:21:05.683
Well, I'm glad you're doing well.

00:21:05.892 --> 00:21:08.603
I'll kill you this time...

00:21:08.811 --> 00:21:10.813
...for real.

00:21:11.022 --> 00:21:14.442
Let's both hit him with our
full powers at the same time.

00:21:14.650 --> 00:21:16.402
We don't have time right now.

00:21:16.611 --> 00:21:18.154
You don't have time? What?

00:21:18.362 --> 00:21:22.158
You're trying to reserve your stamina?

00:21:22.366 --> 00:21:24.994
When you're facing me?

00:21:29.457 --> 00:21:31.000
You stupid brats!

00:21:31.209 --> 00:21:33.669
He's coming! Huh?

00:21:38.508 --> 00:21:43.596
What? I can't move a finger...

00:22:02.031 --> 00:22:04.534
Sorry for being so noisy.

00:22:04.742 --> 00:22:05.993
I see...

00:22:06.202 --> 00:22:09.622
You meant that you didn't have time
to try to hold back on him...

00:22:09.831 --> 00:22:12.583
Didn't expect that from Kageyama-kun.

00:22:12.792 --> 00:22:14.836
Koyama's not responding.

00:22:15.044 --> 00:22:17.463
We're definitely dealing with
someone powerful.

00:22:17.672 --> 00:22:19.173
How pathetic.

00:22:19.382 --> 00:22:24.512
Let's go... Show the intruders
the true terror of Claw.

00:22:25.096 --> 00:22:30.309
We, who live at the corner of the world

00:22:30.518 --> 00:22:34.772
Will get beyond our tears
and head towards the light.

00:22:45.116 --> 00:22:49.495
The dreams and ideals that we believe in

00:22:49.704 --> 00:22:54.458
Feel like they may shatter
as soon as we take our eyes off them

00:22:54.667 --> 00:22:57.503
Thousands, millions of distinct Flashbacks

00:22:57.712 --> 00:22:59.797
Underneath the sky in slow motion,

00:23:00.006 --> 00:23:05.261
So real that I want it to disappear.

00:23:05.469 --> 00:23:10.433
My heart was stolen
a second before the unpredictable,

00:23:10.641 --> 00:23:13.227
After being hurt on a whim

00:23:13.436 --> 00:23:15.771
something from somewhere

00:23:15.980 --> 00:23:19.233
is overflowing and won't stop.

00:23:19.442 --> 00:23:24.572
We, who live at the corner of the world

00:23:24.780 --> 00:23:28.826
Will get beyond our tears
and head towards the light

00:23:29.035 --> 00:23:34.081
Zero, or One? Ten, or Hundred?
We're looking for the answer.

00:23:34.290 --> 00:23:40.463
But over and over again
The sound in our hearts resonates together

00:23:40.671 --> 00:23:42.298
"Yes n "No n

00:23:55.603 --> 00:23:57.229
Mob infiltrates Claw's hideout
along with Teru,

00:23:57.438 --> 00:23:59.857
who has 150% on top of his head,
and the creepy-looking balloon, Dimple.

00:24:00.066 --> 00:24:02.652
They end up facing the Scars,
who childishly refuse to hold back.

00:24:02.860 --> 00:24:03.986
Are you going to be able to win this, Mob?!

00:24:04.195 --> 00:24:05.655
Next time on Mob Psycho 100 Episode 10:

00:24:05.863 --> 00:24:07.114
"The Heinous Aura
- Mastermind~."

00:24:07.323 --> 00:24:07.531
The serious option C involves Blu-rays,
manga volumes, and events!

